---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact — ITMOSS">

  <section class="gradient-hero min-h-[80vh] flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 sm:px-6 text-center py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-lg mx-auto w-full">
      <p class="section-label reveal">CONTACT</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black tracking-tight mt-2 mb-2 sm:mb-4 reveal">
        Get in Touch
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-4 reveal">연락하기</p>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm sm:text-base mb-10 sm:mb-14 reveal reveal-delay-1">
        Collaboration proposals, project inquiries — all welcome.
      </p>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 -mt-8 mb-10 sm:mb-14 reveal reveal-delay-1">협업 제안, 프로젝트 문의 — 무엇이든 환영합니다.</p>

      <div class="space-y-3 sm:space-y-4 w-full reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <a
          href="mailto:jaster@itmoss.com"
          class="card flex items-center gap-4 sm:gap-5 text-left hover:no-underline group p-5 sm:p-6"
        >
          <div class="icon-box icon-box-indigo w-11 h-11 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 shrink-0">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope text-sm sm:text-base"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-0.5 sm:mb-1">Email</p>
            <p class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors truncate">jaster@itmoss.com</p>
          </div>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-auto text-slate-300 group-hover:text-indigo-500 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0"></i>
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://blog.naver.com/itmoss"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="card flex items-center gap-4 sm:gap-5 text-left hover:no-underline group p-5 sm:p-6"
        >
          <div class="icon-box icon-box-green w-11 h-11 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 shrink-0">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-blog text-sm sm:text-base"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="min-w-0">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-green-600 uppercase tracking-widest mb-0.5 sm:mb-1">Notes / Blog</p>
            <p class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors truncate">blog.naver.com/itmoss</p>
          </div>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right ml-auto text-slate-300 group-hover:text-indigo-500 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all shrink-0"></i>
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-10 leading-relaxed">
        We typically respond within 1–2 business days.<br />
        <span class="text-slate-300">영업일 기준 1–2일 내에 답변드립니다.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
